HST Office: ribbon KeyTips with the letters of the familiar office suite, per app and tab.

The letters a command gets on a tab are those of the same command on the same tab of the familiar suite (captured from
the installed suite, data/ribbon/office-keytips-reference.json), so Alt, R, C is New Comment in the Review tab of every
app, and Alt, N, SI is New Slide in the Insert tab of HST Slides while Alt, H, I stays New Slide on its Home tab. The
table HstKeyTipOffice.hxx is generated by scripts/patches/generate-keytips-office-parity.py from
data/ribbon/keytips-office-parity.json; a general letter (HstKeyTipTable.hxx) that clashes with one of these on the same
tab gives way, and its command gets a free letter. Checked by scripts/check-keytips-parity.py.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0); the new header is MPL-2.0 as well.
---
